{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12211170","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1221116001:":{"text":"咦？好漂亮的鱼！","source_cn":"咦？好漂亮的鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD237F994AAAA47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1221116002:":{"text":"难道是……幻彩鲷？！","source_cn":"难道是……幻彩鲷？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE3AAF2745AF994D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1221116003:":{"text":"妈妈，妈妈，你快来看！","source_cn":"妈妈，妈妈，你快来看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF00E08F44398F1D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221117001:1":{"text":"妈妈，你看——！好漂亮的鱼！","source_cn":"妈妈，你看——！好漂亮的鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBB24BBA7AEEEEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221117002:1":{"text":"这……这是是幻彩鲷？！可这种鱼应该只有海岛上才有，怎么会出现在这里？","source_cn":"这……这是是幻彩鲷？！可这种鱼应该只有海岛上才有，怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1875D87B8628091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221117003:1":{"text":"——是大海实现了我的愿望！","source_cn":"——是大海实现了我的愿望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A9CB4E169C0B52D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221117004:1":{"text":"……大海？","source_cn":"……大海？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98FCDF3B3CFA5F2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221117005:1":{"text":"嗯！爸爸说过，只要我乖乖听话，不给你添麻烦，大海就会实现我的心愿。","source_cn":"嗯！爸爸说过，只要我乖乖听话，不给你添麻烦，大海就会实...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB187068D8256D71A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221117006:1":{"text":"妈妈最近总是叹气，所以我偷偷写了一封许愿信，希望大海能送我一条幻彩鲷——爸爸说过，这是他和妈妈求婚时精心准备的礼物。","source_cn":"妈妈最近总是叹气，所以我偷偷写了一封许愿信，希望大海能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF1C36D4D59D7AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221117007:1":{"text":"妈妈，安尔姆希望你能开心一点，爸爸和哥哥肯定也是这么想的！","source_cn":"妈妈，安尔姆希望你能开心一点，爸爸和哥哥肯定也是这么想的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE3EBBD26B9D2D16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221117008:1":{"text":"别担心了，他们可是最厉害的引航员，一定会平安回来的！","source_cn":"别担心了，他们可是最厉害的引航员，一定会平安回来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF2E6A1A8FDF08E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221117009:1":{"text":"好……乖孩子，不愧是我的小安尔姆。妈妈知道了，妈妈……一定会打起精神来的。","source_cn":"好……乖孩子，不愧是我的小安尔姆。妈妈知道了，妈妈……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410243720DC3C607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1221117010:1":{"text":"我们去把幻彩鲷养起来吧？这还是妈妈第二次养这种鱼呢。","source_cn":"我们去把幻彩鲷养起来吧？这还是妈妈第二次养这种鱼呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2720E7B53DF38BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1221117011:1":{"text":"嗯！等爸爸回来看到了，肯定会很高兴的！","source_cn":"嗯！等爸爸回来看到了，肯定会很高兴的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BD9578149DB1BB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1221116001:":{"text":"咦？好漂亮的鱼！","source_cn":"咦？好漂亮的鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD237F994AAAA47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1221116002:":{"text":"难道是……幻彩鲷？！","source_cn":"难道是……幻彩鲷？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE3AAF2745AF994D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_recor